# GitPulse Environment Configuration Template
# Precision GitHub Contribution Engine created by Yatharth Nagpal
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your GitHub OAuth App credentials.

# ─── GitHub OAuth 2.0 Credentials ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Register a GitHub OAuth App at: https://github.com/settings/developers
# - Homepage URL: http://localhost:3000
# - Authorization Callback URL: http://localhost:3000/api/auth/github/callback
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=your_github_client_id_here
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=your_github_client_secret_here

# ─── Application Base URL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set to your local server URL or production domain (e.g. https://app-commit-ten.vercel.app)
APP_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ─── Optional Personal Access Token (PAT) Fallback ─────────────────────────
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
